{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"736444701149757610","content":"\"Sandigil...I. I'm sorry. But I'm not leaving you alone. You have Ophelia and Fabertell. I need to something that feels right, I haven't been myself.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T20:00:59.038000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738486319738650634","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"736444701149757610","content":"rummages through his sack of belongings, pulling out two small wooden boxes.  he opens each, and in each is 2 jars, and one paintbrush.  he moves a full jar to his other box, leaving a half empty jar in one box.  he closes the box with the half jar \"you are clever.... use tis well... and if you don't come back.... I will take care of your school if i can.\" offering a wooden box and a sack of goodberries (40 goodberries each worth 4hp, and 40% of a jar of  Nolzur's Marvelous Pigments)  he pauses and says \"I am used to losing my school... but I will regret losing you... so come back.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T20:03:22.788000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738486922669981726","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
