{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736444701149757610","content":"Copper hops off his, “of course my friend, what can I help you with?","created_at":"2020-07-30T20:49:26.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738498513767366758","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"736444701149757610","content":"\"May I ask.... why are you running for mayor?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T20:49:41.586000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738498577793548390","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736444701149757610","content":"“In all honesty, I hadn’t considered it until recently. I had never planned on it. However a friend and I talked, and he believes that I can do the role justice. So I thought on it, I meditated on the question, and now I think that I can do the job well. I want to help people. And I think I could” he thinks to himself, and looks to Sandigil “why do you wish to run for mayor?”","created_at":"2020-07-30T20:53:48.012000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738499611378974732","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"736444701149757610","content":"\"Similar.... people pointed out that i listen well.... i take care of people.... i fix things without being asked.... while other people play... i do what i can to serve everyone.  They said that the fact i serve everyone with wisdom and understanding.... I should be a leader.  They like I want everyone to have a voice..... and that I want to take down the barriers between us.... we are too seperate.... not a community.......\" pauses \"andthat I want to do this even though i dont want power.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T20:56:16.807000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738500235470307428","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"736444701149757610","content":"\"so..... if you want to be mayor..... does that mean you are not going to go on adventures on the island?  It would be foolish to risk our leadership for exploration and glory would it not?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T20:57:12.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738500469948940308","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"736444701149757610","content":"\"I have had to think much of what kind of leader I want to be.... and If you really want to be mayor.... you cant needlessly risk yourself anymore.  If I win mayor though.... I want you to speak for the workers.... they want a non marriage union for wages\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T20:59:28.349000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T20:59:34.905000Z","id":"738501038855946412","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
