{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"736444701149757610","content":"Copper thinks on this “I have thought of this. And I think I would continue the adventures on the island. Not for glory, but because I feel a leader shouldn’t hide in the safety of the town, while everyone else takes the risk. It would feel wrong, not to join them. Especially if it were possible that I could have helped them in some way if I were there.”","created_at":"2020-07-30T21:03:02.509000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738501937107828746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
